  "saved to this robot.": "已保存到该机器人。",
  "Pick or name your arm": "选择或命名你的机械臂",
  "This quick tour walks you from a fresh setup to a robot that runs a policy you trained yourself: calibrate, record, train, run. It takes about two minutes, and you can leave anytime with Esc.": "本快速教程将带你从全新配置一路走到运行自己训练的策略的机器人：校准、录制、训练、运行。全程约两分钟，随时可按 Esc 退出。",
  "Start here. Choose an existing robot, or type a new name to create one. Everything else in the tour hangs off the arm you select.": "从这里开始。选择已有机器人，或输入新名称创建一个。教程中的其他步骤都围绕你选择的机械臂展开。",
  "Calibrate the arms": "校准机械臂",
  "Calibration teaches the app each joint's range of motion so movements map correctly. Run it once for the leader arm, then the follower. Press Start and follow the on-screen steps.": "校准让应用了解每个关节的行程范围，从而正确映射动作。先为主臂（示教臂）运行一次，再为从臂运行。点击开始并按屏幕提示操作。",
  "Add cameras (if your task needs sight)": "添加相机（如果任务需要视觉）",
  "If the robot has to see what it's doing, add one or more cameras here. They're saved with this robot and reused when you record. Skip this if your task doesn't need vision.": "如果机器人需要“看到”自己在做什么，在这里添加一个或多个相机。相机会随该机器人保存，录制时复用。任务不需要视觉可跳过此步。",
  "Try teleoperation (optional)": "试试遥操作（可选）",
  "Drive the follower arm by moving the leader. It's a good way to confirm calibration feels right before you record anything. This button unlocks once the arm is calibrated.": "通过移动主臂来驱动从臂。这是在录制前确认校准是否到位的好方法。机械臂校准后该按钮才会解锁。",
  "Record a dataset": "录制数据集",
  "A dataset is a set of episodes: one attempt at your task each. Episode time is how long each attempt runs; reset time is the pause to reposition objects between attempts. Aim for 10 to 50 clean episodes to start.": "数据集由多个回合组成，每个回合是一次完整的任务尝试。“回合时长”是每次尝试的运行时间；“重置时间”是两次尝试之间重新摆放物体的停顿。初始目标建议 10 到 50 个干净利落的回合。",
  "Train a policy": "训练策略",
  "Turn your recorded episodes into a policy the robot can run. ACT is fast and a great first choice; SmolVLA is a larger vision-language model. You can train on your own GPU, or rent one in the cloud with a Hugging Face login.": "把录制的回合变成机器人可运行的策略。ACT 速度快，是很好的首选；SmolVLA 是更大的视觉-语言模型。可以用自己的 GPU 训练，也可以登录 Hugging Face 在云端租用。",
  "Watch it train": "观察训练进度",
  "Your training job shows up here with live progress. Once it has a usable checkpoint, a green play button appears on the model so you can run it.": "你的训练任务会显示在这里并实时更新进度。一旦有了可用的检查点，模型上会出现绿色的播放按钮，即可运行。",
  "Run your policy": "运行你的策略",
  "Press the play button on a finished model to let the robot attempt the task on its own, using what it learned from your episodes. This is the payoff of the whole loop.": "点击完成训练的模型上的播放按钮，机器人就会运用从你的回合中学到的东西，自主尝试完成任务。这就是整个流程的收获时刻。",
  "Share on the Hub (optional)": "分享到 Hub（可选）",
  "Log in to Hugging Face to push your datasets and trained models to the Hub, so you can back them up, share them, or train in the cloud.": "登录 Hugging Face，把你的数据集和训练好的模型推送到 Hub，即可备份、分享或在云端训练。",
  "That's the whole loop": "整个流程就是这样",
  "Calibrate, record, train, run. You can reopen this tour anytime from the ? button in the corner. Happy building.": "校准、录制、训练、运行。随时可以点击角落的 ? 按钮重新打开本教程。祝玩得开心！",
